  "description": "WEGLOM crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H96 Ge12 N4 O64 Sm8,2(C12 H8 N2),16(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Sm1 (Sm) has 8 O neighbors; Sm2 (Sm) has 8 O neighbors; Sm3 (Sm) has 8 O neighbors; Sm4 (Sm) has 8 O neighbors; Sm1A (Sm) has 8 O neighbors; Sm2A (Sm) has 8 O neighbors; Sm3A (Sm) has 8 O neighbors; Sm4A (Sm) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 3 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.813-3.859 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 108.87-111.11°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C84H144Ge12N8O80Sm8. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 24 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 16 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
